  "releaseNotes": "NEW: Upgrade support for CassandraCSharpDriver to version 3.23.0\nNEW: Upgrade support for ServiceStack to version 10.3.0\nNEW: Upgrade support for ServiceStack.Redis to version 10.3.0\nNEW: Upgrade support for Azure.Storage.Queues to version 12.28.0\nNEW: Upgrade support for Microsoft.Azure.Cosmos to version 3.63.2\nNEW: Upgrade support for ServiceStack.Redis to version 10.4.0\nNEW: Upgrade support for Azure.Storage.Queues to version 12.28.1\nNEW: Upgrade support for ServiceStack to version 10.4.0\nNEW: Upgrade support for Confluent.Kafka to version 2.16.0\nNEW: Upgrade support for CouchbaseNetClient to version 3.10.0\nNEW: Upgrade support for Google.Cloud.PubSub.V1 to version 3.39.0\nNEW: Upgrade support for StackExchange.Redis to version 3.4.0\nIMPROVEMENT: Added optional switch to disable proxy for tracer communication\nFIX: Added opt-in environment variable to enable W3C traceparent sampled-flag inheritance.\nIMPROVEMENT: Add exctype tag to sdk custom spans to capture exception full name",
